  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ad29fb\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1295417/description_d83f160b-aa52-48c7-bed6-0b3215b886ba.png\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"> <span style=\"color:#a84c0e\">高级铜制</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1295417/description_7301d28b-66b9-4766-9b86-1cfd3c4866e1.png\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"></span></h1><p>高级铜制模组让你能够制作完整的铜制工具套装，包括镐斧锤、锤子和挖掘机。铜制套装性能略低于铁制，但优于石制钻石制，是两者之间的过渡阶段。</p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#a74cdc\"><span style=\"color:#a660cf\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1295417/description_8662770e-37fe-409e-b815-6175632656bb.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#a14624\">紫水晶盔甲、工具和武器属性：</span></span></span></h2><table style=\"width:99.8747%;border:1px solid rgb(207, 72, 23);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\">\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ef3b3b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1295417/description_3335cf8b-14f0-4b9a-8180-b747392fd781.gif\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\"> <span style=\"color:#a34e0f\">盔甲</span></span></strong></h3>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\"><strong>头盔</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\"><strong>胸甲</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:15.7993%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\"><strong>护腿</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5948%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\"><strong>靴子</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:41.2639%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; 护甲值</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.197%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\"><strong>+2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:19.145%;border-color:rgb(207, 72, 23);border-width:1px\"><strong>+5</strong>